774
00:41:12.333 --> 00:41:14.000
No. No.

775
00:41:14.083 --> 00:41:16.250
-Hmm, yeah.
-No, no, no, no.

776
00:41:16.333 --> 00:41:18.958
-Yes.
-That house is m-mine!

777
00:41:19.541 --> 00:41:22.916
