884
00:46:41.666 --> 00:46:45.333
So, basically, I had this relative.
She was my Russian second aunt, right?

885
00:46:45.416 --> 00:46:48.625
And at some point,
she opened her own restaurant in Russia,

886
00:46:48.708 --> 00:46:50.875
