-[Clara] Gross.
-[Diego] Don't move.

933
00:49:02.625 --> 00:49:04.333
-[Diego] Ah!
-[Clara chuckles]

934
00:49:04.416 --> 00:49:05.708
-[Clara] Gross.
-Okay.

935
00:49:05.791 --> 00:49:07.500
-[chuckles] Ew!
-Okay.

936
00:49:07.583 --> 00:49:09.333
-[Clara] Are you taking it?
-Don't move.

937
00:49:09.416 --> 00:49:11.041
-[Clara] All right.
-[Diego] Don't move.

938
