<i>would've been possible before right now.</i>

973
00:50:54.208 --> 00:50:55.208
<i>Right now, though…</i>

974
00:50:56.208 --> 00:50:57.041
<i>Right now…</i>

975
00:50:58.250 --> 00:50:59.083
