-[Clara chuckles]

980
00:51:10.625 --> 00:51:13.000
How come I haven't seen this one either?

981
00:51:13.875 --> 00:51:15.333
That makes sense. Yeah.

982
00:51:15.416 --> 00:51:18.000
Because, well,
I made it for the Asian market,

983
00:51:18.083 --> 00:51:19.333
