1002
00:52:06.291 --> 00:52:09.750
That sounds really cool!
Maybe I can go there with you to see it.

1003
00:52:10.458 --> 00:52:11.291
Well,

1004
00:52:12.500 --> 00:52:13.333
that's…

1005
00:52:14.166 --> 00:52:15.000
um…

