He asked to make a reservation that night.

1173
01:00:43.208 --> 01:00:44.375
Christmas!

1174
01:00:44.916 --> 01:00:46.708
And… so what?

1175
01:00:48.083 --> 01:00:48.916
[Clara sighs]

1176
