1206
01:02:16.916 --> 01:02:17.750
Wow!

1207
01:02:19.625 --> 01:02:20.458
Cool, huh?

1208
01:02:23.958 --> 01:02:27.375
Hey, Chip!
Wh-what are you staring at, huh? Huh?

1209
01:02:27.458 --> 01:02:29.208
