1212
01:02:34.916 --> 01:02:37.875
To me, I don't know why,
but it's beautiful.

1213
01:02:37.958 --> 01:02:41.833
I mean, it's a real look.
It says something profound.

1214
01:02:41.916 --> 01:02:43.750
-Fuck you, shithead!
-Armando!

1215
01:02:43.833 --> 01:02:45.750
-[Susanna laughs]
-[Armando] Thank you.

1216
01:02:46.541 --> 01:02:48.500
