1221
01:03:00.125 --> 01:03:01.500
[Clara] <i>"With this in mind,</i>

1222
01:03:01.583 --> 01:03:04.166
<i>we offer a new collective experience</i>
<i>from the Monroe</i>

1223
01:03:04.250 --> 01:03:07.833
<i>in which the most disruptive performances</i>
<i>contemporary art has to offer</i>

1224
01:03:07.916 --> 01:03:11.791
